                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a decent clone of the old DOS game, LaserLight.  The author clearly put very little effort into the game - the animations are crap, the music is awful, the UI is horrendeous, and the only options are for volume.  Yet despite the author's best efforts, the game is pretty fun because the puzzles are good.\n\nFor anyone else who has been looking for a good LaserLight game, this is a good time waster for the price.",
